<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S8.SS5" title="In 8. Ablations ‣ Don’t Blind Your VLA:Aligning Visual Representations for OOD Generalization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8.5 </span>Loss functions and alignment coefficient</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S9" title="In Don’t Blind Your VLA:Aligning Visual Representations for OOD Generalization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">9 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
